OL,3,GNEWSAMusician hopes to bring brass band
OL,4,Aback to town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trumpeter who played in one of her
OL,7,Ftown's last brass bands as a child
OL,8,Fhopes a day celebrating the music will
OL,9,Frevive the tradition.
OL,11,FHelen Quayle was part of
OL,12,FBarrow-in-Furness's Vickers Brass Band
OL,13,Falongside her father Jack, and later
OL,14,Fbecame a professional musician.
OL,16,FThe Cumbrian town has not had a brass
OL,17,Fband for more than a decade and Quayle
OL,18,Fhopes a day of live music as part of
OL,19,Fits annual festival will inspire the
OL,20,Freturn of one.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
